# Conformance probe pack for `until:59 chars:ascii8` (spec 0.22, ruling 20):
# the terminator is `;`, so NUL is an ordinary character on decode and on
# encode. Public. No kinds. Most significant bit first.
#
#   label  8-bit characters up to the code 59
format     conformance-long-until-semicolon
version    0.22.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
field   probe.label  until:59  chars:ascii8
